- `crates/mlmf-ggml/tests/ggml-types.tsv` and `crates/mlmf-ggml/src/types.rs`
  — ggml's type codes and block geometry (elements/block, bytes/block,
  alignment), measured from `ggml-org/llama.cpp` commit
  `9d57ce456c94d241dde672b2db9cf18879766568`: `ggml/include/ggml.h` (codes),
  `ggml/src/ggml.c` (elements/block), `ggml/src/ggml-common.h`
  (bytes/block, alignment). Facts about the format, not transcribed source
  code; cross-checked against the upstream static asserts at that commit.
