  spec's own legend for "required", quoted from `ggml-org/ggml`
  `docs/gguf.md` (read 2026-09-05).
- `crates/mlmf-gguf/src/header.rs` — version-support table from
  `docs/gguf.md`'s `## Version History` (same read), and a byte-swap
  detection heuristic that has no corresponding spec section and is
  `ggml-org/llama.cpp`'s own, pinned at commit
  `9d57ce456c94d241dde672b2db9cf18879766568`, `ggml/src/gguf.cpp:497`.

No source code from either repository is copied or reproduced; these are
facts about file formats and short, attributed spec quotations.


